[08/12 04:30:49     10s] @file 81: # 5. DELAY CORNERS (Merging Logic and Physics)
[08/12 04:30:49     10s] @file 82: # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[08/12 04:30:49     10s] @@file 83: create_delay_corner -name dc_typical -timing_condition {tc_cond} -rc_corner {rc_typical}
